<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apple South raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apple South raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it upgraded Apple South Inc to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- shares rose one to 14-3/8 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
